th":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1633505/52c3e272-30b8-45d0-8273-415b59f4298d.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1633505/52c3e272-30b8-45d0-8273-415b59f4298d.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Entire apartment\nProperty Description:\nThe ~40m2 apartment is located on the elevated ground floor of a quiet multi-family building and was recently renovated. The apartment features triple-glazed windows and has been freshly painted. The spacious living area, with direct access to the balcony, provides a modern and cozy atmosphere. The contemporary bathroom with a walk-in shower was previously renovated. The apartment is fully furnished, making it ideal for one person or a couple looking for a peaceful environment with excellent transport connections.\n\nFeatures:\n• Fitted kitchen with washing machine, dishwasher, fridge with freezer, stove, oven, extractor hood, microwave, and various cooking utensils\n• Large living/sleeping area with a 140 cm wide bed, pull-out couch with storage, and 55-inch flat-screen TV\n• High-speed internet and cable TV\n• Modern bathroom with walk-in shower\n• Balcony with green views and balcony furniture\n• Private cellar space\n• Public parking spaces in front of the building\n\nAdditional Information\nThe apartment is located in a quiet residential area of Erkrath with excellent access to the A46 and A3 highways. Via the nearby Hilden motorway junction, both Düsseldorf and Wuppertal are easily reachable. The Erkrath S-Bahn station and the old town of Erkrath are within walking distance. The old town offers numerous shops, cafés, and a pharmacy, covering all essential daily needs. Additionally, the famous Neandertal is just a short drive away, offering a variety of recreational activities in nature.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"private"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"no"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"shared"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"shared"},"pets":{"value":"yes"},"playMusic":{"value":"yes"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"40"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"yes"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":105000,"deposit":150000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"1050.00","deposit":"1500.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":3,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":0,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-06-01"}],"updated":"2026-04-14T09:00:06Z","__utId__":"ut1633505"}]